cat > models/phi_3_5_mini_instruct/README.md << 'EOF'
# Phi-3.5-mini-instruct

The model weights are not included in this repo (too large for git).

To run the project, download the model into this folder:

    hf download microsoft/Phi-3.5-mini-instruct --local-dir models/phi_3_5_mini_instruct

The project loads it from this path (see MODEL_PATH in src/agent/config.py).
EOF